  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.44,
      "text": "Friday, November 13th, Alex has $2,540, and the camera he wants is $18.99. Easy, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.196,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.126
    },
    {
      "start": 10.76,
      "end": 17.2,
      "text": "Not quite. Most of that money is already spoken for, bills, a laptop he's still paying off,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.196,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.126
    },
    {
      "start": 17.54,
      "end": 23.78,
      "text": "everyday spending until payday, and a cushion he never touches. What's really his to spend?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.196,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.126
    },
    {
      "start": 25.68,
      "end": 26.32,
      "text": "$872.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.162
    },
    {
      "start": 28.12,
      "end": 34.22,
      "text": "So before he pays, Alex does one thing. Right there on the Paypal button is worth.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.162
    },
    {
      "start": 35.18,
      "end": 36.22,
      "text": "One swipe.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.162
    },
    {
      "start": 38.18,
      "end": 41.52,
      "text": "Worth asks for just one thing. Connect Paypal.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.162
    },
    {
      "start": 42.12,
      "end": 47.4,
      "text": "He signs in on Paypal's own page once. No spreadsheets, no typing in bills.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.162
    },
    {
      "start": 47.4,
      "end": 53.32,
      "text": "Through Paypal's MCP server, Worth reads his activity and finds what a balance can't show.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.111,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.049
    },
    {
      "start": 54.2,
      "end": 58.7,
      "text": "Rent on the first. Three payments left on a laptop he split with pay in four.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.111,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.049
    },
    {
      "start": 59.46,
      "end": 62.1,
      "text": "And a payday that's still 17 days away.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.111,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.049
    },
    {
      "start": 63.46,
      "end": 67.88,
      "text": "So of that $25.40, $872 is safe to spend today.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.111,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.049
    },
    {
      "start": 68.64,
      "end": 71.56,
      "text": "And Worth keeps that number currently, quietly, read only.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.111,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.049
    },
    {
      "start": 72.94,
      "end": 75.4,
      "text": "And the camera? Not today.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.138,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.25
    },
    {
      "start": 76.4,
      "end": 81.1,
      "text": "Buy it now and he's overdrawn in a week, $726 under by Payday.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.138,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.25
    },
    {
      "start": 82.2,
      "end": 87.64,
      "text": "But wait until Tuesday, December 15th, the day after a client pays his invoice, and it fits.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.138,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.25
    },
    {
      "start": 88.44,
      "end": 89.3,
      "text": "Cushion intact.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.138,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.25
    },
    {
      "start": 90.98,
      "end": 97.6,
      "text": "What about payin' for? Worth lays all four payments on the calendar, right in between the laptops.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.138,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.25
    },
    {
      "start": 97.6,
      "end": 103.04,
      "text": "The second, lands three days before payday, and his balance dips under the cushion.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.47
    },
    {
      "start": 104.54,
      "end": 108.3,
      "text": "Worth doesn't push either way. It shows where each payment lands.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.47
    },
    {
      "start": 109.7,
      "end": 114.06,
      "text": "And it isn't only for big purchases. Ask Worth anything about your money.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.47
    },
    {
      "start": 114.82,
      "end": 117.56,
      "text": "Too much coffee? $94.50 since mid-October.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.47
    },
    {
      "start": 118.26,
      "end": 120.24,
      "text": "Next payday? November 30th.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.47
    },
    {
      "start": 121.02,
      "end": 124.66,
      "text": "Ask what happens if he buys today, and Worth works the chart for you.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.47
    },
    {
      "start": 125.52,
      "end": 128.36,
      "text": "Claude reads the question, Worth's engine does the math.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 128.84,
      "end": 131.7,
      "text": "And every sentence is checked before he sees it.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 132.82,
      "end": 134.84,
      "text": "So Alex saves it for the 15th.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 137.08,
      "end": 139.2,
      "text": "And when the day comes, Worth checks again.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 140.44,
      "end": 141.4,
      "text": "It fits.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 142.82,
      "end": 143.86,
      "text": "So he pays.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 148.86,
      "text": "With PayPal.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.062
    },
    {
      "start": 153.44,
      "end": 154.74,
      "text": "PayPal knows what you've spent.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.059
    },
    {
      "start": 155.36,
      "end": 157.36,
      "text": "Worth turns that into the day you can buy.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.059
    },
    {
      "start": 158.16,
      "end": 159.68,
      "text": "One swipe before you pay.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.059
    },
    {
      "start": 160.84,
      "end": 164.56,
      "text": "Your balance says you can. Worth tells you the day you actually can.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.059
    }
  ],
